# Nickel · Ni · gate 28

**Nickel** (Ni) is element **28** of the periodic table — a **transition metal**, period 4, group 10, d-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **58.693**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
Coins and stainless steel; magnetic; with iron it makes the planet's molten core.

